1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,188
Barcelona recorded 40.5 degrees Celsius on Wednesday, the highest temperature in 112 years of local records, Euronews reports.

2
00:00:11,138 --> 00:00:18,505
Spain issued severe heat warnings in parts of Catalonia and Valencia as the heatwave continued.

3
00:00:18,505 --> 00:00:21,447
The story is not only about weather.

4
00:00:21,447 --> 00:00:29,594
Extreme heat is becoming a public-health and housing problem, especially for people who cannot keep their homes cool.

